---
import Button from '@/components/ui/Button.astro';
import Icon from '@/components/ui/Icon.astro';

/*
  Opening sequence: Centered high-impact layout.
  Clean typography, standardized eyebrow, simple informative subtitle,
  and dual action CTAs.
*/
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-neutral-200/80 bg-white">
  {/* Ambient dot matrix grid background */}
  <div
    class="hero-bg-grid pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-40"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 pt-16 pb-20 text-center sm:px-6 sm:pt-20 sm:pb-24 lg:pt-24 lg:pb-28">
    {/* Subtitle / Eyebrow in standard site style */}
    <p
      class="hero-anim eyebrow inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-lg font-medium text-[#777777]"
      style="--anim-delay: 60ms;"
    >
      <span class="size-2 rounded-[2px] bg-brand-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      Ecosistema software per il settore alberghiero
    </p>

    {/* Hero Headline */}
    <h1
      class="hero-anim font-display mt-6 text-[2.35rem] leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-[3.25rem] md:text-[3.75rem] lg:text-[4.25rem]"
      style="--anim-delay: 140ms;"
    >
      Lavora meglio con software{' '}
      <em class="font-display font-normal text-brand-700 italic">
        costruiti per il settore alberghiero
      </em>
    </h1>

    {/* Simple clean subtitle text */}
    <p
      class="hero-anim mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 sm:text-lg"
      style="--anim-delay: 220ms;"
    >
      SeasonsJob unisce gestione del personale, comande di sala, acquisti e
      cantina in un unico ambiente operativo per pianificare i turni, coordinare
      la sala e controllare la cantina.
    </p>

    {/* CTA Action Buttons */}
    <div
      class="hero-anim mt-9 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:gap-4"
      style="--anim-delay: 300ms;"
    >
      <Button
        href="#soluzioni"
        size="lg"
        class="shadow-md shadow-neutral-900/10"
      >
        Scopri le soluzioni
        <Icon name="arrow-right" class="size-4" />
      </Button>
      <Button href="/contatti/" variant="secondary" size="lg">
        Richiedi informazioni
      </Button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-bg-grid {
    background-image: radial-gradient(#d4d4d8 1.25px, transparent 1.25px);
    background-size: 24px 24px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(
      ellipse 70% 60% at 50% 40%,
      black 20%,
      transparent 80%
    );
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(
      ellipse 70% 60% at 50% 40%,
      black 20%,
      transparent 80%
    );
  }

  .hero-anim {
    animation: hero-in 700ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.7, 0.3, 1) both;
    animation-delay: var(--anim-delay, 0ms);
  }

  @keyframes hero-in {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(10px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hero-anim {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
</style>
